<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Account Deletion Request – Student Face Attendance</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Request deletion of your Student Face Attendance account and associated personal data.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="./delete-account.html">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #1c1e21;
      background: #f6f7f9;
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 64px; }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3f5efb, #6a5cff);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 24px; }
    header p { margin: 0; opacity: .9; font-size: 14px; }
    article {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e4e6eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 26px 24px;
      margin-top: -24px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }
    h2 { font-size: 17px; margin: 22px 0 8px; }
    h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    p, li { font-size: 15px; color: #3a3d42; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 8px 0; }
    a { color: #3f5efb; }
    .meta { font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    form { margin-top: 18px; }
    label { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
    input[type="email"], input[type="text"], textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cdd0d5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: #fff;
      color: #1c1e21;
    }
    textarea { min-height: 100px; resize: vertical; }
    .hint { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 4px; }
    button, .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: #3f5efb;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    button:hover, .btn:hover { background: #2f4de0; }
    .alt {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: #f0f2f5;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    footer { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 22px; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      body { background: #0f1115; color: #e6e6e6; }
      article { background: #171a20; border-color: #262a33; box-shadow: none; }
      p, li { color: #c9cdd6; }
      input[type="email"], input[type="text"], textarea {
        background: #1f232b; border-color: #3a4050; color: #e6e6e6;
      }
      .alt { background: #1f232b; }
      .meta, footer, .hint { color: #9aa1ad; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>Account Deletion Request</h1>
  <p>Student Face Attendance</p>
</header>
<div class="wrap">
<article>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: October 11, 2026</p>

  <p>You can request deletion of your <strong>Student Face Attendance</strong> account and
  the personal data linked to it (login, name, email address). We will complete the
  request <strong>within 30 days</strong>.</p>

  <h2>Option 1 — Delete from inside the app (fastest)</h2>
  <p>Open the app → <strong>Settings</strong> → <strong>Delete account</strong>.
  This permanently deletes your login and profile immediately.</p>

  <h2>Option 2 — Request deletion from this page</h2>
  <p>Use this form if you cannot open the app. Submitting opens your email app
  with a pre-filled deletion request to our support address.</p>

  <form id="delForm" action="mailto:smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
    <label for="email">Registered email address</label>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email">

    <label for="name">Your name (optional)</label>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Full name" autocomplete="name">

    <label for="note">Anything else? (optional)</label>
    <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="School / institution name, or any details that help us locate your account."></textarea>

    <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Account deletion request — Student Face Attendance">
    <button type="submit">Send deletion request by email</button>
    <p class="hint">This opens your default mail app addressed to
    <a href="mailto:smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com">smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com</a>
    with your details filled in. Send the email to complete the request.</p>
  </form>

  <div class="alt">
    <strong>Option 3 — Email us directly.</strong>
    Email <a href="mailto:smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com?subject=Account%20deletion">smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com</a>
    from your registered address with the subject line
    <em>Account deletion request</em>. We will confirm and delete within 30 days.
  </div>

  <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your login account, name and email address.</li>
    <li>Any face photo or face template linked to your personal account.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Class, student and attendance records created for your institution remain with
  your institution (they are institutional records, not your personal account data).</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com">smartfaceattendanceofficial@gmail.com</a></p>
</article>
<footer>Student Face Attendance</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
